=2 Walkthrough
>**__Before starting this quest, you must have fished up 100 different fish.**__
* Doing the quest {q:Fisherman's Heart|Fisherman's Heart|Fisherman's Heart}, will allow you to see how many unique fish you have caught, by talking to {n:Katsunaga} in {z:Mhaura}.

>**__Must have {p:Rise of the Zilart} / {p:Chains of Promathia} / {p:Treasures of Aht Urhgan} / {p:Wings of the Goddess} / {p:Seekers of Adoulin} / {p:Scars of Abyssea} expansions installed.**__
* Talk to {n:Irmilant} to start the quest.
* You will need to catch, in any order, the following 5 Legendary fish. Afterwards, you must trade them to {n:Irmilant}:
** {i:Matsya|Matsya|5468}
** {i:Dragon's Tabernacle|Dragon's Tabernacle|6374}
** {i:Quicksilver Blade|Quicksilver Blade|6371}
** {i:Phantom Serpent|Phantom Serpent|6375}
** {i:Lord of Ulbuka|Lord of Ulbuka|6372}
* If you have already caught one of these legendary fish prior to activating this quest, (see {n:Katsunaga} in {z:Mhaura} to check) you may purchase that fish from the Auction House, Bazaar or have someone else fish it up for you and it will still count towards quest completion. Basically, the only trigger to {n:Irmilant} accepting a fish is that it is registered under {n:Katsunaga} that it has been caught by you.
** Example: You fished up {i:Matsya|Matsya|5468} for the {i:Shaper's Shawl|Shaper's Shawl|11009} which caused {i:Matsya|Matsya|5468} to be registered by {n:Katsunaga}, you are able to purchase a {i:Matsya|Matsya|5468} off the Auction House and trade into {n:Irmilant} for credit.
* After you trade in all five, trade your {i:Ebisu Fishing Rod|Ebisu Fishing Rod|17011} to him in order to upgrade it.

